# Frame budget guard at 25 fps (two vertical blanks per picture, see main.c):
# up to speed through the first hills and curves (bumping into the rival
# ahead), steering, onto the grass; palms and rivals in view all the way.
wait-serial "AGK t0"
press up 300
press up+left 40
press up+right 80
press up 200
expect-no-dropped-frames
# measured ~77% (peaks 83%) of the two-frame budget: the road projection and
# the copper loop are most of it
expect-max-load 90
